{"id":8657732325,"name":"[Open Test] World Sail","desc":"Legacy Piece is an open world RPG game inspired by the anime One Piece. This game is not the complete version, so please expect bugs and glitches!\r\n\r\nPower Core Abilities spawn once every 30 minutes and de-spawn after 15 minutes!\r\n\r\nChests spawn every 15 minutes!\r\n\r\nBasic Controls:\r\nM1 = Combat\r\nE = Evade (When being attacked)\r\nZ,X,C,V,G = Ability Skills (If unlocked)\r\nLeft Ctrl = Run\r\nB = Enhancement (If unlocked)\r\nH = Conqueror Spirit (If bought)(Or 5/100chance to get on first life)\r\nN = Observation\r\n\r\nCurrent Abilities:\r\n- Barrier\r\n- Fire\r\n- Light\r\n- Quake\r\n- Dark\r\n- Sand\r\n- Ice\r\n- Bomb\r\n- Lightning\r\n- Invisibility\r\n- Mochi\r\n- Magma\r\n- Operation\r\n- Paw\r\n- Dragon [WIP]\r\n- Rubber\r\n- Smoke\r\n- Love\r\n- Chop\r\n- Gravity","path":"/game/8657732325-world-sail","slug":"8657732325-world-sail","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c0c0f9d44dd5ec7aed8063185497ce3205c5357caca3b8f7e2711e8a1b4bcf77.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4625ef5e5cbee1fa8188c38f7610093f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1504378,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-04-07T16:33:30.633Z","creator":{"name":"Legacy Piece Online","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"624f125a30946fc3c6ade687","title":"| Inf Stats/Exp/Beli","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c780f1","gameId":8657732325,"name":"[Open Test] World Sail","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"8657732325-world-sail","path":"/game/8657732325-world-sail","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8657732325},"slug":"Open-Test-World-Sail-or-Inf-StatsExpBeli-1750","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":13971,"executes":40,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":